{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1456170-aberrant-effects-and-feats-of-mega-stamina","id":1456170,"title":"[Aberrant] effects and feats of mega stamina","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-08-05T01:12:59-07:00","id":1456170,"title":"[Aberrant] effects and feats of mega stamina","content":"I know mega stamina gives an extra 40 years of lifespan per dot until at 6 you no longer age, increases healing rate and such.<br /> <br /> But what sort of feats can you do with and without the mega edges and also how would it affect day to day life? What sort of effect does it have on the novas body ie organs etc, In 1e it mention a basic nova metabolism that all novas had regardless of if they had mega stamina, is this still the case in 2e or do novas need mega stamina to get any benefits like disease or poison resist.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26058-aeonstorm","name":"Aeonstorm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-05T03:04:26-07:00","id":1456174,"title":"","content":"Well I imagine you can stay up for days on end without feeling tired. You are a dynamo of energy. Disease isn\u2019t really covered in Core, but poison is handled as indirect damage so yes you gain enhancement versus that. Mega Stamina in general doesn\u2019t do as much as it did before.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1580-andrewm9","name":"andrewm9","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-05T03:07:03-07:00","id":1456175,"title":"","content":"Novas don\u2019t have the basic toughness they had in 1e, all the effects come from somewhere now, a power, a mega attibute or mega edge, taking them out and you have a regular person.<br /> <br /> Mega Stamina (and the other resilience mega attributes) are not as active as Might and Dexterity, as they are usually less active and more reactive. So it\u2019s not much about feats, but about ignoring or recovering easier from what affects you.<br /> <br /> Mega Stamina grants scale when dealing with any thing that would make you tired, hungry, sleepy, thirsty, etc. So, the time to feel this things is a order of magnitude longer than usual per dot, Mega Stamina 1 would keep you awake for a week if you need, resist hunger, dehydration for a few weeks before start getting you weak, hold your breath for several minutes with no side effects, run a marathon at your short run speed, etc. It affects all conditions that would affect your stamina, so, most diseases, non lethal poisons, but also medicines and drugs in general. It doesn\u2019t mean you are not affected, it means it lasts less and has less effects because the body reacts better.<br /> <br /> Also, it grants enhancements when dealing with indirect damage, so anything that causes damage and is not a direct attack, like a poisonous gas, nuclear fall out, extreme weather, air pressure, injected poison, most diseases, etc, will be easier to resist. <br /> <br /> Finally fast healing, not regeneration level of healing, but still a lot faster than usual and with no need of medical attention, so a broken bone that would take 2 weeks to heal takes a week with Mega Stamina 1. But it also applies to damage caused by poisons, diseases, and indirect damage.<br /> <br /> Conclusion, Mega Stamina makes you take longer to be affected, reduce the effects if affected and reduce the time to get rid of the resulting effects.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-05T03:11:45-07:00","id":1456176,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>andrewm9</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1456170-aberrant-effects-and-feats-of-mega-stamina?p=1456174#post1456174\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well I imagine you can stay up for days on end without feeling tired. You are a dynamo of energy. Disease isn\u2019t really covered in Core, but poison is handled as indirect damage so yes you gain enhancement versus that. Mega Stamina in general doesn\u2019t do as much as it did before.</div> </div> </div> </div>No Mega Attribute works as before, they are not used in all dice pools, they have a more narrative effect than a real rule describing and they are meant to be less potent, basically working as a door to get Mega Edges, that are what really increases the flexibility.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-06T05:57:34-07:00","id":1456226,"title":"","content":"So they changed the whole basic nova metabolism where novas needed to eat several times more than baselines. So now unless they have mega stamina they aren\u2019t any healthier or tougher than a baseline?<br /> <br /> That\u2019s interesting but it does make buying at least a dot or two of mega stamina more important. Personally I would make sure to get or work towards at least 3 dots and get the m-edges immunity, regeneration, and adaptation. Which would cover you against everything but really high rating poisons or indirect sources of damage, I think high levels of hard radiation is rating 5 so that might get through.<br /> <br /> But all in all that should give you a lifespan of 220+ years and a pretty robust constitution. Not sure what could get through that that you can\u2019t regenerate until your body deals with what you got. Which is useful if any anti nova faction tries to covertly deal with you?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26058-aeonstorm","name":"Aeonstorm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-06T06:36:48-07:00","id":1456231,"title":"","content":"If you think there's a decent chance you're going to be poisoned, then yes, Mega-Stamina seems a wise investment.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-06T06:44:41-07:00","id":1456232,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aeonstorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1456170-aberrant-effects-and-feats-of-mega-stamina?p=1456226#post1456226\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So they changed the whole basic nova metabolism where novas needed to eat several times more than baselines. So now unless they have mega stamina they aren\u2019t any healthier or tougher than a baseline?</div> </div> </div> </div>Basically yes.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> That\u2019s interesting but it does make buying at least a dot or two of mega stamina more important. Personally I would make sure to get or work towards at least 3 dots and get the m-edges immunity, regeneration, and adaptation. Which would cover you against everything but really high rating poisons or indirect sources of damage, I think high levels of hard radiation is rating 5 so that might get through. </div> </div> </div>I think you are taking the value of low Mega Stamina away. It\u2019s like saying that if you are not Scale 3 durability you are not bullet proof. Taking a sun burn from being exposed to Chernobyl reactor (instead of dying in minutes) or feeling a bit sick from the bite of a cobra (instead of dying a painful death), or having a bruise after being hit by a cannon shot is not a sign of weakness.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> But all in all that should give you a lifespan of 220+ years and a pretty robust constitution. Not sure what could get through that that you can\u2019t regenerate until your body deals with what you got. Which is useful if any anti nova faction tries to covertly deal with you? </div> </div> </div>Yes, it can be useful if you are fighting a very well armed group of experiment Nova hunters, but you can probably live without it\u2026","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-06T07:42:11-07:00","id":1456238,"title":"","content":"Getting 3 dots of mega stamina is personal preference more than anything. Lower levels are still highly useful especially with the edges supplementing them.<br /> <br /> It\u2019s just if I was a nova erupting on n day there are certain abilities I would prefer to have in case the situation goes south.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26058-aeonstorm","name":"Aeonstorm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-06T21:44:47-07:00","id":1456279,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aeonstorm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1456170-aberrant-effects-and-feats-of-mega-stamina?p=1456226#post1456226\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So they changed the whole basic nova metabolism where novas needed to eat several times more than baselines. So now unless they have mega stamina they aren\u2019t any healthier or tougher than a baseline?</div> </div> </div> </div>This is something I don't like about the new setting. I found being human+ by being a Nova an interesting thing from the original setting, good for justifying the not super tough Novas being able to survive things that a human shouldn't<br /> <br /> However an argument that being Tier 3 is how the game models that as having the lower target number increases the chance they will survive accidents, hostile environments, and boosts the chance of everything else they do to boot. I just wish it was more explicit about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4178-stanlemon","name":"stanlemon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}